1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
(English Subtitle) Growing.Pains.S01E15 -= Slice.of.Life.II =- Subripped by zerox

2
00:01:06,180 --> 00:01:07,820
-还给我 -没门
- Give it back. - No way.

3
00:01:08,040 --> 00:01:09,660
-还给我 -没门
- Give it back. - No way.

4
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:11,880
妈妈，她是个疯婆子
Look out, Mom, she's a wild woman.

5
00:01:12,220 --> 00:01:14,640
你两住手
Okay, stop it. Both of you.

6
00:01:15,200 --> 00:01:17,640
这个周末爸爸很忙，我怎么说了？
Now, what did I tell you about disturbing your father this weekend?

7
00:01:18,600 --> 00:01:20,480
总的来说是别打扰他
Well, in a nutshell, you told us not to.

8
00:01:21,120 --> 00:01:21,880
如果打扰他呢？
And if you did?

9
00:01:22,060 --> 00:01:23,800
你会把我们吊起来关在地下室
You'd hang us by our thumbs in the basement.

10
00:01:25,640 --> 00:01:27,820
那就对了，拿绳子来
That's right. Now, get me the rope.

11
00:01:32,892 --> 00:01:35,973
爸爸，请听我解释.
Dad, I'm confident when you hear my story...

12
00:01:36,060 --> 00:01:38,140
对不起，我错了
I'm sorry, I'm sorry. I was wrong.

13
00:01:38,820 --> 00:01:42,540
爸爸，我叫了本安静一点 可是他就是不听话
Dad, I tried to tell Ben to be quiet, but did he listen? No, he persisted...

14
00:01:43,620 --> 00:01:45,560
对不起，我错了
I'm sorry, I'm sorry. I was wrong.

15
00:01:46,500 --> 00:01:47,940
亲爱的，写得怎样了？
How's the paper coming, honey?

16
00:01:50,540 --> 00:01:53,380
我同意你的说法 别着急，你会写完的
I agree completely, but don't worry, you'll get it done.

17
00:01:53,480 --> 00:01:54,340
鸡蛋要怎么煮？
Now, how do you want your eggs?

18
00:01:55,760 --> 00:01:57,000
不好意思，没有辣酱了
I'm sorry, I think we're out of Tabasco.

19
00:01:58,680 --> 00:02:02,280
我找些别的酱吧，拿着
I'll find some. I'll find some. Here, take this.

20
00:02:02,388 --> 00:02:06,004
这些先吃着，其余的马上就好
This'll get you started, and I'll bring the rest out in a minute.

21
00:02:13,520 --> 00:02:14,767
妈妈，地板打蜡了？
Mom, did you just wax this floor?

22
00:02:14,767 --> 00:02:17,003
怪不得滑起来特别快
Because I picked up an incredible amount of speed...

23
00:02:17,003 --> 00:02:18,605
对不起，我错了
I'm sorry, I'm sorry. I was wrong.

24
00:02:18,605 --> 00:02:21,983
杰森，来，回去工作 我来料理
Here. Now, Jason, go back to work. I'll take care of it.

25
00:02:25,120 --> 00:02:27,820
-妈妈，这是意外 -麦克，这是最后通牒
- Mom, it was an accident, I swear. - Mike, this is your last warning.

26
00:02:27,960 --> 00:02:29,720
若再在家里溜冰.
If we catch you skateboarding in the house again...

27
00:02:29,849 --> 00:02:31,480
不许你接电话，不许听音响.
you'll lose your phone privileges, your stereo...

28
00:02:31,480 --> 00:02:32,760
还有两个月不给钱你
and your allowance for two months.

29
00:02:33,253 --> 00:02:34,754
妈妈
Mom.

30
00:02:34,754 --> 00:02:36,197
行了，行了
Okay.

31
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:41,340
-你好，里奇 -西弗太太
- Oh, hi, Richie. - Hi, Mrs. Seaver.

32
00:02:42,220 --> 00:02:42,700
不是吧
Oh, no.

33
00:02:44,120 --> 00:02:46,000
里奇，旧报纸昨天不是收过了吗？
Richie, didn't you collect for the paper yesterday?

34
00:02:46,160 --> 00:02:48,140
这次不是为了公事
Oh, this isn't a professional visit, Mrs. Seaver.

35
00:02:48,760 --> 00:02:49,340
我来是.
I'm here...

36
00:02:50,260 --> 00:02:52,440
里奇，我说过在图书馆见面的
Richie, I told you to meet me at the library.

37
00:02:53,380 --> 00:02:58,280
考虑到我俩之间关系的进展.
Well, I just thought, I mean, in light of our new relationship and all...

38
00:02:58,800 --> 00:02:59,520
我来这做功课吧
that we could work here.

39
00:03:01,614 --> 00:03:03,525
关系？
Relationship?

40
00:03:05,640 --> 00:03:07,540
你们是？男女关系？
What are you guys now, like boyfriend and girlfriend?

41
00:03:07,854 --> 00:03:10,106
进展如何？
Kind of going steady?

42
00:03:11,960 --> 00:03:15,000
她没告诉你？我们结婚了
Didn't she tell you? Carol and I are married.

43
00:03:16,840 --> 00:03:19,680
-什么？ -这是社会科的课题
- What? - It's a social studies project.

44
00:03:19,820 --> 00:03:22,260
我们要制订夫妻的预算
Yeah, we have to work out a budget for a married couple.

45
00:03:22,260 --> 00:03:25,340
是模拟夫妻
A simulated married couple.

46
00:03:27,180 --> 00:03:30,140
你们散发出洋溢的爱
Come on, guys, I can feel the love in this room.

47
00:03:31,920 --> 00:03:33,980
你们是如何走在一起的？
So, what brought you two kids together, anyway?

48
00:03:35,782 --> 00:03:37,431
命运的安排
Destiny.

49
00:03:38,300 --> 00:03:40,500
还有我贿赂了全班的男同学.
And the fact that I paid off all the other guys in class...

50
00:03:40,500 --> 00:03:41,380
要他们不要选你
so they wouldn't pick you.

51
00:03:41,921 --> 00:03:46,507
什么？里奇？你买下了我？
What? Richie, you bought me?

52
00:03:47,660 --> 00:03:49,174
是的
Yeah.

53
00:03:50,240 --> 00:03:52,240
也许这方式比较老套
I guess I'm just old-fashioned that way.

54
00:03:53,820 --> 00:03:56,560
够了!我不要和你做课题，出去!
That's it. I am not doing this project with you. Now, out!

55
00:03:56,700 --> 00:03:58,780
星期一不交，我们会不及格
If we don't turn the paper in Monday, we get an F.

56
00:04:02,560 --> 00:04:04,840
我可以遇见报纸的头条.. “凯罗.西弗不及格，举国震惊”
I can see the headlines now: "Carol Seaver gets an F. Nation in shock.

57
00:04:04,980 --> 00:04:06,980
“总统结束休假回白宫”
"President to fly back from Santa Barbara."

58
00:04:08,681 --> 00:04:10,161
麦克
Mike.

59
00:04:10,240 --> 00:04:12,340
里奇，算了，我们还是做功课吧
Come on, Richie, let's get this over with.

60
00:04:13,340 --> 00:04:15,500
亲爱的，随时恭候
Ready when you are, dear.

61
00:04:18,140 --> 00:04:21,700
-他们真可爱.. -闭嘴
- Isn't that cute... - Not another word.

62
00:04:31,704 --> 00:04:32,560
Hey.

63
00:04:32,560 --> 00:04:35,040
谢谢，亲爱的 请放在桌子上
Thanks, honey. Just set it on the desk there, please.

64
00:04:36,180 --> 00:04:37,060
好的
Okay, sure.

65
00:04:41,800 --> 00:04:43,600
杰森，休息一下吧
Listen, Jason. Why don't you take a break?

66
00:04:43,680 --> 00:04:46,040
-咱闲聊闲聊 -不行
- We could have a little chat. - I can't, honey.

67
00:04:46,085 --> 00:04:47,920
我要把它写完
I've really got to get this done.

68
00:04:47,920 --> 00:04:48,909
Oh.

69
00:04:50,460 --> 00:04:53,540
要不暂停一阵子，咱聊聊.
But how about a short break, and then we could talk...

70
00:04:53,660 --> 00:04:55,660
麦姬，不行，我一定要完成
Maggie, no, I've really got to finish up here.

71
00:04:55,900 --> 00:05:00,500
-聊两句也不行..？ -麦姬
- But don't you think a little conversation... - Maggie.

72
00:05:00,500 --> 00:05:02,940
-你到底要聊什么？ -我？
- What do you want to talk about? - Who? Me?

73
00:05:04,203 --> 00:05:06,823
-没什么 -那好
- Oh, nothing. - Okay.

74
00:05:07,280 --> 00:05:10,580
瞧孩子们的照片
Gosh, look at this picture of the kids.

75
00:05:10,700 --> 00:05:13,280
麦克当时才8岁，瞧他的乖样
Mike must have been about eight years old. Wasn't he a cutie-pie?

76
00:05:13,720 --> 00:05:17,600
我记得二年级老师称他为“小魔鬼”
I believe the word his second grade teacher used was "devil boy."

77
00:05:18,980 --> 00:05:21,120
可她住院后，麦克送她卡片了
Oh, come on, he sent her a card in the hospital.

78
00:05:21,120 --> 00:05:22,432
是啊
Yeah.

79
00:05:22,855 --> 00:05:25,840
瞧凯罗，学东西一直都这么快
Oh, and look at Carol. She was always such a quick learner.

80
00:05:25,840 --> 00:05:29,080
所以才戴上这么一副大眼镜
Yeah. That's why she's got alphabet soup up her nose.

81
00:05:30,663 --> 00:05:34,182
还有本，多么无忧无虑
Yeah, little Ben. He was always such a happy baby.

82
00:05:34,260 --> 00:05:37,780
每次弄湿尿布都哈哈大笑
Yeah. I remember the way he used to laugh every time he'd fill a diaper.

83
00:05:39,072 --> 00:05:40,452
是啊
Yeah.

84
00:05:42,240 --> 00:05:46,340
有一次我去了艾伦家.
You know, I was over at Ellen Harper's the other day...

85
00:05:46,340 --> 00:05:49,320
看到她们家杰西卡在学走路
and I saw Jessica take her first steps.

86
00:05:50,280 --> 00:05:51,860
太有意思了
It was so exciting.

87
00:05:52,020 --> 00:05:53,920
是很有意思，那孩子都17岁了
I would think so. The girl's 17.

88
00:05:56,220 --> 00:05:58,780
-那是马乔里 -是的，马乔里
- You're thinking of Marjorie. - Marjorie, yeah.

89
00:05:58,791 --> 00:06:00,640
杰森，可惜你不在场.
Anyway, Jason, you should've seen it.

90
00:06:00,640 --> 00:06:03,700
杰西卡那两条胖胖的小腿.
Jessica stood up on her chubby little legs...

91
00:06:03,700 --> 00:06:06,640
摇摇晃晃走了3步.
and took three chubby little steps...

92
00:06:06,640 --> 00:06:10,080
然后胖胖的脸着地了
and then fell on her chubby little face.

93
00:06:12,940 --> 00:06:17,280
杰森，想过再要一个孩子吗？
Jason, do you ever think about having another child?

94
00:06:19,320 --> 00:06:20,960
想过
Oh, yes, I do, Maggie.

95
00:06:21,300 --> 00:06:22,960
有时候还梦见过呢
Sometimes I even dream about it.

96
00:06:23,883 --> 00:06:27,733
-是吗？ -结果被吓醒了
- You do? - And then I wake up screaming.

97
00:06:33,540 --> 00:06:35,340
麦姬，我了解你的心情
Maggie, I know what you're going through.

98
00:06:36,729 --> 00:06:39,441
-是吗？ -是的，你这种年龄的妇女.
- You do? - Yes. It's a syndrome...

99
00:06:39,580 --> 00:06:42,040
常常会有想再生一个孩子的.
and it's very common among women your age...

100
00:06:42,040 --> 00:06:44,260
这种综合症
who suddenly feel the urge to have one more baby.

101
00:06:45,260 --> 00:06:46,700
有什么不好？
Well, what's wrong with that?

102
00:06:46,700 --> 00:06:50,240
没什么，但你刚恢复工作.
Well, nothing, except you've just gone back to work...

103
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:53,220
而且家里要再加一个房间
and we'd have to add a room onto the house.

104
00:06:54,760 --> 00:06:57,600
我们一家已经很完美了
Anyway, I thought we already had the family we wanted.

105
00:06:58,620 --> 00:07:00,880
杰森，别单纯用理性来思考.
Come on, Jason, those are just rationalizations...

106
00:07:00,980 --> 00:07:02,300
再感性地想想看
but stop and think about it a minute.

107
00:07:02,820 --> 00:07:06,400
有真正的理由让我们 不能再要一个孩子吗？
Can you give me one real reason why we shouldn't have another child?

108
00:07:08,200 --> 00:07:09,080
等等
Wait here.

109
00:07:22,900 --> 00:07:25,880
行，接下来检查基本费用.
Okay, next we have to go over the basic home expenses...

110
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:27,260
水电煤气，暖气费.
water, heat, gas, electric...

111
00:07:28,880 --> 00:07:32,540
-你还在吗？ -致死不渝
- Are you with me? - Till death do us part.

112
00:07:36,600 --> 00:07:39,360
你们俩刚蜜月归来？
Hey, I haven't seen you crazy kids since you got back from the honeymoon.

113
00:07:40,960 --> 00:07:43,080
里奇，带着宠物.
Hey, Richie, did you have any trouble finding a hotel...

114
00:07:43,080 --> 00:07:44,020
找酒店有困难吗？
that would take pets?

115
00:07:44,697 --> 00:07:45,420
麦克
Mike.

116
00:07:45,420 --> 00:07:48,080
没关系，我来处理
No, it's all right, Carol, I'll handle this.

117
00:07:51,437 --> 00:07:52,650
麦克
Mike...

118
00:07:54,900 --> 00:07:56,760
你要收回刚才的话
I'll have to ask you to take that back.

119
00:07:58,744 --> 00:08:01,840
里奇，别误会了，凯罗可是个好东西
No, no, Richie, don't get me wrong. I mean, Carol's a great catch.

120
00:08:01,840 --> 00:08:05,000
清理清理，去了骨头就会很好吃
And as soon as she's cleaned, scaled and deboned, she's fine.

121
00:08:05,660 --> 00:08:06,940
麦克，我警告你
And now I'm warning you, Mike.

122
00:08:07,140 --> 00:08:09,300
谁也不能侮辱我的模拟太太
Nobody talks to my simulated wife like that.

123
00:08:11,160 --> 00:08:14,420
模拟兴否，我都爱她
Simulated or not, I love her.

124
00:08:17,500 --> 00:08:18,800
你闯祸了!
Oh, now see what you done?

125
00:08:19,065 --> 00:08:21,881
亲爱的，别哭，老公来了
Honey, don't cry. Your Richie's coming.

126
00:08:26,180 --> 00:08:29,320
你疯了？妈妈禁止你溜冰
What, are you crazy? Mom told you not to do that.

127
00:08:29,540 --> 00:08:30,920
怎样？要告发我？
What are you gonna do? Tell on me?

128
00:08:31,100 --> 00:08:32,200
你以为我不敢？
I'm kicking it around.

129
00:08:33,045 --> 00:08:35,055
你怎么证明我在溜冰？
How you gonna prove it?

130
00:08:38,260 --> 00:08:43,920
找证据还真不容易
Oh, I don't think evidence will be such a problem.

131
00:08:49,580 --> 00:08:51,020
本，本，本.
Ben, Ben, Ben.

132
00:08:52,440 --> 00:08:54,580
我还能对你说什么呢？
What can I say about you that hasn't already been said?

133
00:08:54,680 --> 00:08:56,420
可以说我快要发财了
That I'm about to become a rich man.

134
00:08:56,903 --> 00:08:58,651
本，替我顶罪
Look, Ben, you got to take the rap for me here.

135
00:08:58,860 --> 00:08:59,872
你是初犯
Now, you're a first-time offender.

136
00:08:59,872 --> 00:09:01,791
爸妈只会要你赔偿玻璃的费用
Mom and Dad'll only make you pay for the window...

137
00:09:01,807 --> 00:09:02,987
回头我还给你
and I'll pay you back for that.

138
00:09:03,080 --> 00:09:03,680
-另加30块 -30块？
- That, plus $30. - $30?

139
00:09:06,112 --> 00:09:07,428
手续费
Overhead.

140
00:09:09,620 --> 00:09:12,740
-本，我没那么多钱 -那就对不起了
- Ben, I don't have that kind of money. - I'm sorry to hear that, Mike.

141
00:09:13,500 --> 00:09:15,020
外面怎么了？
Hey, what's going on in there?

142
00:09:15,121 --> 00:09:17,234
本，我是你哥哥，我爱你
Ben, you're my brother. I love you.

143
00:09:17,924 --> 00:09:21,003
好吧，我可以给你点优惠
Okay, Mike, I'm gonna cut you some slack here.

144
00:09:21,220 --> 00:09:23,600
其实钱并不重要，对不？
Because, after all, money isn't that important, is it, Mike?

145
00:09:24,820 --> 00:09:25,780
对，对
No. No.

146
00:09:25,880 --> 00:09:28,267
重要的是一个人.
What's more important is what one human being can do...

147
00:09:28,267 --> 00:09:29,687
帮忙另一个人
for another human being.

148
00:09:30,020 --> 00:09:30,980
对，对
Right, right.

149
00:09:31,520 --> 00:09:34,180
所以这个周末你要成为我的仆人
That's why I'd like you to be my personal servant for the weekend.

150
00:09:35,207 --> 00:09:36,260
你这!
What? You little...

151
00:09:36,260 --> 00:09:39,880
干嘛这么吵..谁干的？
What was that noise in... Hey, who did this?

152
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:41,600
溜冰板？
Is that a skateboard?

153
00:09:42,740 --> 00:09:43,580
好吧，我依你
Okay, I'll do it.

154
00:09:43,580 --> 00:09:47,820
妈妈，爸爸，也许你们不相信.
Mom, Dad, I know this is unbelievable, but...

155
00:09:47,820 --> 00:09:51,760
我拿了麦克的溜冰板玩 结果飞出去了
I was fooling around on Mike's skateboard, and the thing went flying.

156
00:09:52,920 --> 00:09:57,220
-本，是你？ -是的，对不起
- You did this, Ben? - Yeah. And I'm really, really sorry.

157
00:09:57,360 --> 00:10:01,160
对不起也没用 这要从你的零花钱里面扣
Well, sorry just isn't good enough, Ben. That's gonna come out of your allowance.

158
00:10:02,340 --> 00:10:04,940
若是再在家里溜冰.
And if we ever catch you skateboarding in the house again...

159
00:10:04,940 --> 00:10:07,340
我要你吃不了，兜着走!
you're gonna discover the true meaning of the word "sorry."

160
00:10:08,920 --> 00:10:11,300
我去收拾掉碎玻璃
Well, I'd better clean up that broken glass.

161
00:10:16,140 --> 00:10:18,860
老弟，你处理得条条是道
All right, little bro. We handled that pretty well.

162
00:10:19,240 --> 00:10:20,520
慢着
Freeze, sleaze.

163
00:10:22,740 --> 00:10:26,200
-什么？ -我们之前好像有协议
- What? - I believe we had a little arrangement.

164
00:10:28,920 --> 00:10:30,560
等等，刚才只是说笑.
Wait a minute, Ben, you didn't take that little joke...

165
00:10:30,560 --> 00:10:32,780
仆人的事，你可别当真
about the servant business seriously, did you?

166
00:10:33,080 --> 00:10:34,280
妈妈
Oh, Mom.

167
00:10:34,587 --> 00:10:38,764
我..会服侍你
I ought to... pamper you silly.

168
00:10:42,595 --> 00:10:46,078
我算好了，没超出预算
I have my figures ready. We're still way under budget.

169
00:10:46,199 --> 00:10:49,305
里奇，消遣这一项花费是0
Richie, you've got $0 down for entertainment.

170
00:10:50,200 --> 00:10:52,380
我们在家里消遣就好了
I kind of figured we'd have home entertainment.

171
00:10:53,640 --> 00:10:55,460
生11个孩子怎么样？
How do you think we got 11 children?

172
00:10:56,142 --> 00:10:57,746
11个孩子？
Eleven children?

173
00:10:58,200 --> 00:10:59,360
荒谬!
I don't believe it.

174
00:10:59,440 --> 00:11:02,280
你收买了我 然后把我当作下蛋的母鸡
I mean, first you buy me, and then you turn me into a baby machine.

175
00:11:03,060 --> 00:11:04,640
这不是我们的共同愿、望吗？
I thought that's what we both wanted.

176
00:11:06,740 --> 00:11:10,120
够了，我的愿、望是和你分居
That's it. I'll tell you what I want. I want a separation.

177
00:11:10,740 --> 00:11:13,320
把预算分成两份
We're dividing the budget into two separate households.

178
00:11:13,320 --> 00:11:18,000
-那孩子呢？ -孩子都归你
- What about the kids? - You keep the kids.

179
00:11:18,598 --> 00:11:20,509
你找我的律师谈吧
You'll be hearing from my attorney.

180
00:11:23,240 --> 00:11:25,000
生气时仍旧迷人
God, she's cute when she's angry.

181
00:11:27,780 --> 00:11:28,820
你的三明治
Your sandwich.

182
00:11:30,060 --> 00:11:32,900
天哪，这是什么？
Oh, dear. What do I see here?

183
00:11:33,313 --> 00:11:35,826
照你的吩咐，3份花生酱.
Ben, it's just like you ordered, three parts peanut butter...

184
00:11:35,860 --> 00:11:38,180
一份蜜饯，还有奶油.
one part marshmallow, a dollop of cream cheese...

185
00:11:38,180 --> 00:11:40,080
最后加一粒半葡萄干
topped with one and a half raisins.

186
00:11:40,740 --> 00:11:43,300
但我没说过要面包皮
Yes, but I still see a speck of crust.

187
00:11:43,300 --> 00:11:46,520
我最讨厌面包皮了
You know my feelings about crust.

188
00:11:48,460 --> 00:11:50,100
好吧，我去弄掉
Okay, I'll cut it off.

189
00:11:50,680 --> 00:11:52,520
麦克，这样不行
No, Michael, that just won't do.

190
00:11:53,840 --> 00:11:56,540
依我看来，再弄一份吧
In the state I'm in, I'll need an all-new another sandwich.

191
00:11:57,880 --> 00:11:59,460
再弄一份？
A new sandwich?

192
00:11:59,740 --> 00:12:05,180
我要香肠，奶酪再加法国芥末
I see salami and cheese, and a tangy French mustard.

193
00:12:06,045 --> 00:12:09,150
-你，你.. -妈妈.
- I ought to... - Oh, Mom.

194
00:12:10,200 --> 00:12:13,320
-好吧，好吧.. -好什么？
- Okay, okay. - "Okay, okay," what?

195
00:12:16,480 --> 00:12:19,160
大老爷
Okay, okay, Lord Ben.

196
00:12:33,060 --> 00:12:36,540
-可以坐一会儿吗？ -可以
- Mind if I sit here a second? - Sure, fine, sit.

197
00:12:39,500 --> 00:12:43,880
-我一直在想.. -想吧
- You know, I've been thinking... - Sure, fine, think.

198
00:12:45,140 --> 00:12:47,100
想起斯哥姆湖畔的别墅
About that summer home on Squam Lake...

199
00:12:48,480 --> 00:12:51,160
我们就暂停分期付款吧
you know, maybe we should hold off putting down that deposit.

200
00:12:51,600 --> 00:12:54,000
好的，暂停分期付款
Sure, fine, hold off.

201
00:12:55,120 --> 00:12:57,640
暑假不去那里度假.
Because if we stay home this summer...

202
00:12:57,640 --> 00:13:00,820
就能在这添一个房间了
maybe we could add that new room onto the house.

203
00:13:01,140 --> 00:13:02,900
好的，添一个房间
Sure, fine, add a room.

204
00:13:04,640 --> 00:13:06,900
添房间是因为.
I was thinking we'd need an addition because...

205
00:13:08,760 --> 00:13:09,960
我也许怀孕了
I might be having a baby.

206
00:13:10,820 --> 00:13:12,460
好的，怀孕吧
Sure, fine, have a baby.

207
00:13:21,920 --> 00:13:24,620
-怀孕？ -还不确定
- A baby? - Now, I'm not sure yet.

208
00:13:26,080 --> 00:13:26,940
医生两点会打电话来告知结果
The doctor has to call back at 2:00 with the test results.

209
00:13:27,620 --> 00:13:28,280
怀孕？
A baby?

210
00:13:29,480 --> 00:13:31,180
杰森，其实早就想告诉你了.
Jason, I didn't tell you sooner because I knew...

211
00:13:31,180 --> 00:13:32,920
但是你要集中精神写文章，只是.
you needed to concentrate on your article, but then...

212
00:13:32,920 --> 00:13:34,880
我等电话越等越急.
I got so nervous waiting for the doctor's call...

213
00:13:35,280 --> 00:13:37,020
麦姬，这意味着什么？
Maggie, do you know what this means?

214
00:13:39,720 --> 00:13:41,920
我们又有个孩子了!
It means we're having a baby.

215
00:13:43,640 --> 00:13:45,900
-你开心？ -开心？
- You mean you're glad? - Glad?

216
00:13:49,000 --> 00:13:52,280
我的心情怎能用“开心”来形容？
Maggie, "glad" doesn't begin to describe how I feel.

217
00:13:52,660 --> 00:13:56,260
我感到“很开心”!
I feel... really glad!

218
00:13:57,340 --> 00:14:00,280
我还以为你不想要孩子了
But Jason, I thought you didn't want to have another child.

219
00:14:00,740 --> 00:14:02,500
那是在没有怀孕的前提下
Well, that was before I got to know him.

220
00:14:03,420 --> 00:14:06,540
孩子来得真不是时候
Oh, honey, it's so weird that this should happen now...

221
00:14:06,560 --> 00:14:08,500
我刚刚恢复工作
just when I started back to work.

222
00:14:08,560 --> 00:14:12,140
我准备不去上班，留下来当妈妈
I guess I'II... Well, I guess I'll just have to quit my job to be a mommy.

223
00:14:12,360 --> 00:14:15,700
不，现在情况完全不同了
No. No, no. Don't you see? It's different this time, Maggie.

224
00:14:16,240 --> 00:14:18,820
我已经在家了，我来带孩子吧
I'm already home. I'll be the mommy.

225
00:14:19,580 --> 00:14:24,060
-那就不能用人奶喂养了 -是的
- I guess that rules out breastfeeding. - No... Yeah.

226
00:14:25,080 --> 00:14:26,960
其余的我都能胜任
But I can do everything else.

227
00:14:27,680 --> 00:14:31,000
喂牛奶，换尿布，洗澡什么的
I can bathe him, I can burp him, I can change him.

228
00:14:31,800 --> 00:14:33,200
指导孩子的人生路
I'll guide his destiny.

229
00:14:35,660 --> 00:14:37,160
我的机会来了
This is my chance.

230
00:14:38,220 --> 00:14:41,480
可以补偿我错过这3个孩子的事情
This is my chance to recapture all the things I've missed with the other kids.

231
00:14:42,100 --> 00:14:45,560
-不怕孩子们整天哭？ -我把耳朵塞起来
- Like their crying all day long? - I'll wear earplugs.

232
00:14:46,040 --> 00:14:50,320
-堆积如山的尿布.. -我把鼻子塞起来
- Like tons of dirty diapers? - I'll wear nose plugs.

233
00:14:51,620 --> 00:14:52,660
凌晨3点喂奶？
3:00 a.m. Feedings?

234
00:14:52,660 --> 00:14:55,540
麦姬，若你是如此的消极.
Maggie, if you're gonna have a negative attitude about this...

235
00:14:55,540 --> 00:14:57,140
那我来带孩子是好事
it's a good thing I'm raising this kid.

236
00:14:58,060 --> 00:15:01,560
既然你这么想，自己去生一个吧
Well, if that's the way you feel about it, have your own darn baby.

237
00:15:02,580 --> 00:15:04,000
你以为我不想？
I could if I wanted to.

238
00:15:04,957 --> 00:15:06,499
麦姬.
Maggie...

239
00:15:06,726 --> 00:15:09,064
我希望有你的孩子
I want to have your baby.

240
00:15:09,620 --> 00:15:12,520
杰森，你真是太好了
Oh, Jason, that's sweet.

241
00:15:15,220 --> 00:15:18,260
孩子啊，孩子.
Baby, baby, baby, baby

242
00:15:29,680 --> 00:15:30,460
凯罗.
Hi, Carol.

243
00:15:32,780 --> 00:15:36,260
-怎样了？ -很好，你呢？
- How's it going? - Fine. How are things with you?

244
00:15:37,200 --> 00:15:39,560
凯罗，你回来吧 我的预算不够开销
Carol, you gotta come back. I can't make it alone on my budget.

245
00:15:41,060 --> 00:15:43,160
我和你的钱是一样多的
Hey, you've got just as much money as I do.

246
00:15:43,840 --> 00:15:45,420
我有11个孩子
I've got all 11 kids.

247
00:15:46,520 --> 00:15:49,200
我们住破棚子，每天吃饲料
We live in a shack. All we have to eat is fish food.

248
00:15:50,960 --> 00:15:52,640
里奇，我看你是在想入非非了
Richie, I think you're getting a little carried away here.

249
00:15:54,180 --> 00:15:57,180
我花了60块，怎能不想入非非？
Hey, I think I'm entitled to get a little carried away for my $60.

250
00:15:59,080 --> 00:16:00,480
你说什么？
What are you talking about?

251
00:16:00,780 --> 00:16:03,458
买你这个搭档的花费
Well, that's what I had to pay to get you as a partner.

252
00:16:04,717 --> 00:16:08,625
里奇，你疯了，这可不是个小数目
But, Richie, that's crazy. I mean, that's a lot of money.

253
00:16:09,980 --> 00:16:11,600
凯罗，金钱不代表什么
Money isn't everything, Carol.

254
00:16:12,091 --> 00:16:15,668
需要的话，600块我也能拿出来
I would've paid $600 for you, if that's what it took.

255
00:16:17,160 --> 00:16:19,180
这真是一句.
That's the sweetest...

256
00:16:19,180 --> 00:16:22,620
最接近精神病的情话
and most borderline psychotic thing anyone's ever said to me.

257
00:16:24,640 --> 00:16:28,400
我就是这样
Hey, that's just the kind of guy I am.

258
00:16:31,360 --> 00:16:34,320
不过你还是不满足
But I guess that's not good enough for you.

259
00:16:35,560 --> 00:16:36,480
里奇.
Look, Richie.

260
00:16:38,020 --> 00:16:42,680
也许我们能破镜重圆.
Maybe we can arrange a simulated trial reconciliation...

261
00:16:44,860 --> 00:16:46,060
直到星期一为止
until Monday.

262
00:16:49,220 --> 00:16:51,980
凯罗，欢迎你回家
Carol, welcome home.

263
00:16:53,232 --> 00:16:55,112
我去告诉孩子们
Wait till I tell the kids.

264
00:16:59,580 --> 00:17:01,560
至高无上的本 兰波玩具的衣服烫好了
Your Rambo doll clothes are ready, your most exalted Ben.

265
00:17:04,510 --> 00:17:07,585
麦克，我们很不满意
Oh, Michael, we are not pleased.

266
00:17:08,460 --> 00:17:10,480
这条皱褶太难看了
Rambo's crease here looks terrible.

267
00:17:12,020 --> 00:17:15,420
穿皱皱的裤子，又怎能保卫国土？
How's the man supposed to defend our country in wrinkled pants?

268
00:17:20,540 --> 00:17:25,760
我的饼干好了，我要趁热吃
Oh, my cookies are ready, Michael. And I like them hot.

269
00:17:26,499 --> 00:17:28,139
好的
Right.

270
00:17:30,400 --> 00:17:32,100
换台，7频道
Channel 7, Mike.

271
00:17:45,400 --> 00:17:48,087
我的饼干呢？我闻到焦味了
My cookies, Michael. I could swear I smell them burning.

272
00:17:48,087 --> 00:17:49,761
好的
Right.

273
00:17:51,760 --> 00:17:53,740
麦克，接电话
The phone, Michael.

274
00:17:56,896 --> 00:18:00,174
这里是本.西弗大王的家
Seaver residence. Home of the Royal Ben...

275
00:18:00,900 --> 00:18:02,620
喂，珍妮
Jennifer, hi.

276
00:18:03,402 --> 00:18:05,144
珍妮？
Jennifer?

277
00:18:10,140 --> 00:18:12,320
我吩咐过，不能接私人电话
I said, no personal calls.

278
00:18:15,281 --> 00:18:17,888
本，是俏臀妹妹打来的
Ben, that was Wonderbuns.

279
00:18:21,754 --> 00:18:26,363
俏臀妹妹？我是本
Hello, Wonderbuns? Big Ben here.

280
00:18:26,392 --> 00:18:30,363
麦克没空.. 麦克，你在干什么？
Mike is not available... Mike, what do you think you're doing?

281
00:18:30,520 --> 00:18:34,500
-我要造反 -麦克，不得无礼
- I'm revolting. - No argument there, Mike.

282
00:18:34,880 --> 00:18:37,069
-你这小厮.. -我要告诉爸爸是你打破玻璃的
- Why, you little... - I'm gonna tell Dad you broke the window.

283
00:18:37,069 --> 00:18:40,306
我要告发你敲诈勒索，你这小流氓
Well, I'm gonna tell Dad you're a blackmailer, you little gangster.

284
00:18:40,306 --> 00:18:41,807
爸爸会把你关起来
Well, Dad's gonna ground you.

285
00:18:41,807 --> 00:18:44,560
爸爸会把你关起来，还会用刑
Well, Dad's gonna ground you and spank you.

286
00:18:44,560 --> 00:18:46,540
你们两个别吵
Hold it right there, you two.

287
00:18:48,840 --> 00:18:51,140
你们真可爱，我来拍拍照
You boys look so cute, I gotta take your picture.

288
00:18:57,120 --> 00:18:58,920
还记得你们小时候.
Hey, you remember when you guys were just little babies...

289
00:18:59,000 --> 00:19:00,240
玩拍拍手吗？
how we used to play Pat A Cake?

290
00:19:00,460 --> 00:19:02,020
-记得 -当时很好玩是吧
- Yeah. - That was big time fun.

291
00:19:02,600 --> 00:19:04,400
现在玩玩怎样？
What do you say we play a quick game right now?

292
00:19:06,180 --> 00:19:09,300
-好吧 -还是快点玩吧
- Yeah, that's good. - If I were you, I'd get in on this.

293
00:19:09,702 --> 00:19:13,300
“拍拍手，拍拍手..”
"Pat a cake, pat a cake, baker's man

294
00:19:13,300 --> 00:19:15,440
“我们都是好朋友”
"Bake me a cake as fast as you can"

295
00:19:15,780 --> 00:19:19,480
孩子们，你们都要被关起来 释放日期另行通知
Boys, you're both grounded until further notice, okay?

296
00:19:21,400 --> 00:19:22,600
来笑一个
Smile, come on.

297
00:19:24,150 --> 00:19:25,890
“拍拍手..”
Pat a cake, pat a cake.

298
00:19:32,258 --> 00:19:36,035
-完成了 -太好了
- I'm finished. - That's great, honey.

299
00:19:36,120 --> 00:19:37,820
我就知道你能写完
I knew you'd finish your paper today.

300
00:19:37,940 --> 00:19:40,020
不是论文完成，我集中不了精神
No, not my paper. I couldn't concentrate on my paper.

301
00:19:40,060 --> 00:19:41,620
我说的是给孩子取名
- I have a list of baby names. - Oh.

302
00:19:41,801 --> 00:19:46,112
这是我的首选，独特，上口.
Here's my first choice. This is distinctive, it's commanding...

303
00:19:46,240 --> 00:19:48,900
还很贵气，“朱利叶斯”
it's noble. It's Julius.

304
00:19:50,476 --> 00:19:52,990
朱利叶斯.西弗？
Julius Seaver?

305
00:19:54,880 --> 00:19:55,940
还不赖吧？
Not bad, huh?

306
00:19:56,860 --> 00:19:58,880
还有许多选择，以防万一
I got plenty more, just in case.

307
00:19:59,060 --> 00:20:00,360
万一什么？
Just in case of what?

308
00:20:00,720 --> 00:20:03,320
万一他是个喜剧演员
Well, just in case he turned out to be a comedian.

309
00:20:03,422 --> 00:20:05,435
就叫做西西弗
Sid Seaver?

310
00:20:07,020 --> 00:20:09,460
如果只是普通的美国公民
And if he were an all-American, everyday kid.

311
00:20:09,528 --> 00:20:12,474
-就叫做比弗.西弗 -比弗.西弗
- Beaver Seaver. - Beaver Seaver.

312
00:20:13,480 --> 00:20:15,820
杰森，万一是女儿呢？
Jason, what if he's a girl?

313
00:20:16,260 --> 00:20:17,980
那我还得再想想
Uh-oh. I better get back to work.

314
00:20:18,760 --> 00:20:21,740
要是个女儿，我会帮她取名为.
Jason, I was thinking that if it's a girl, that we could name her...

315
00:20:21,740 --> 00:20:23,582
丽贝卡
Rebecca.

316
00:20:25,220 --> 00:20:27,440
丽贝卡.西弗，好听，我喜欢
Rebecca Seaver. That's pretty. I like that.

317
00:20:27,960 --> 00:20:31,920
-希望她长得像你 -我也是
- I hope she looks just like you. - Me, too.

318
00:20:32,260 --> 00:20:34,740
要是她胸口长毛那就太滑稽了
Because she'd look kind of silly with a hairy chest.

319
00:20:36,922 --> 00:20:39,503
-是医生打来的 -先别接
- That's him. - Don't answer it.

320
00:20:39,880 --> 00:20:41,940
我们应该一起接
We've both got to be on the phone at the same time.

321
00:20:42,000 --> 00:20:43,229
我到客厅去接，等等
I'll get the phone in the living room. Hold on.

322
00:20:43,229 --> 00:20:47,675
-好，快 -好
- Okay, hurry. - Go.

323
00:20:48,000 --> 00:20:50,840
喂，大夫
Hello? Yes, Doctor.

324
00:20:53,960 --> 00:20:54,480
Uh-huh.

325
00:20:55,020 --> 00:20:55,880
知道了
I see.

326
00:20:57,710 --> 00:20:59,346
好
Yes.

327
00:21:00,800 --> 00:21:02,660
谢谢你打过来
Well, thank you for calling, Doctor.

328
00:21:11,980 --> 00:21:14,620
也许这样是最好的
Well, I guess it's all for the best.

329
00:21:14,760 --> 00:21:17,300
我还没做好思想准备呢
I mean, I wasn't really ready to go through all that again.

330
00:21:17,320 --> 00:21:19,200
而且要你抽出这么多时间.
And it wouldn't have been fair to ask you to take...

331
00:21:19,200 --> 00:21:21,940
对你来说很不公平
so much time away from your practice. I mean, I guess...

332
00:21:22,401 --> 00:21:25,015
也许时机真的不对
I guess it just isn't the time.

333
00:21:30,560 --> 00:21:32,540
你真的想要一个孩子是吧？
You really wanted to have a baby, didn't you?

334
00:21:35,320 --> 00:21:36,600
是的，我很想
Yeah. I guess I did.

335
00:21:39,220 --> 00:21:40,820
我也是
Well, I did, too.

336
00:21:42,480 --> 00:21:45,960
这是个坏消息，也是个好消息
I guess we could look at this as good news and bad news.

337
00:21:48,320 --> 00:21:50,920
坏消息是暂时没有孩子
Bad news is that we're not going to have a baby right now.

338
00:21:52,500 --> 00:21:55,680
好消息是我们还可以继续努力生孩子
And the good news is that we can keep trying to have a baby.

339
00:21:57,440 --> 00:21:58,840
也许要花几个星期时间
Even if it takes weeks.

340
00:22:01,880 --> 00:22:02,840
甚至几个月
Or months?

341
00:22:04,880 --> 00:22:07,780
关键在于我们要坚持不懈
Yes, the important thing is that we keep at it.

342
00:22:10,000 --> 00:22:12,010
我会尽我所能
Well, I'm willing to do my part.

343
00:22:18,060 --> 00:22:20,120
好吧，废话休提，我们开始吧
All right, the party's over. Let's get to work.

344
00:22:22,400 --> 00:22:23,880
本，把溜冰板给我
Ben, give me my skateboard.

345
00:22:24,040 --> 00:22:26,520
先把我的内裤从屋顶上拿下来
Not until you get my underwear down from the roof.

346
00:22:35,500 --> 00:22:36,900
写得真棒
Very impressive, honey.

347
00:22:36,900 --> 00:22:40,480
甚至可以说是写得龙飞凤舞
I might even go so far as to say that your paper is brilliant.

348
00:22:41,200 --> 00:22:42,360
继续说
Go so far, say it.

349
00:22:43,800 --> 00:22:45,660
晚饭时庆祝一下
What do you say we celebrate over dinner?

350
00:22:46,200 --> 00:22:46,700
好主意
Good idea.

351
00:22:51,680 --> 00:22:53,640
-妈妈大人 -爸爸大人
- Yes, your Momness. - Yes, your Dadness.

352
00:22:54,880 --> 00:22:56,800
两份普通三明治
We'll have two club sandwiches.

353
00:22:57,120 --> 00:22:59,720
加蛋黄酱，要涂满一点
Just a hint of mayo, on whole-wheat toast.

354
00:22:59,940 --> 00:23:03,360
不要面包皮，我们最恨面包皮了
Oh, and hold the crust. You know how we feel about crust.

355
00:23:50,629 --> 00:23:52,654
